  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to OECD fior activities  to GovNet, Anti-Corruption TaskTeam and the Working Group on Bribery in Business Transactions.  The Norwegian funding will be used for studies and research, dialogue  and meetings with stakeholders in order to collect new knowledge and best practice, for the  development of global and accetable principles, guidelines and approaches to solutions within the various working areas supported with particular relevance for developing countries</narrative>
  </description>
